        "Title": "Crime Wave: Streets of Whittleton Creek",
        "Location": "LOCATION_NORTHAMERICA",
        "PublicId": "122707627115",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/skunk/scene_skunk.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository ff44c8ce-c100-4c37-b3dc-271b41634724).Image",
        "Description": "Whittleton Creek is being ravaged by crimes, and we need someone to fix this.\rFirst, you will replace Grant Masterson. We need a new sheriff.\rThen you&apos;ll take care of four troublemakers:\r- Gayle Pooley. Carries explosives without permit.\r- Dale Anderson, the mailman.\r- Jared Hawkins, for feeding wildlife. Without permit.\r- Olive Haskel, who is rude towards everyone.\rFeel free to send him off with fireworks, people will like that.\r\rYou might ask &quot;why a mailman?&quot;, and that&apos;s for you to figure out.",
